WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.347
Fractions in a recipe

2
00:00:02.347 --> 00:00:31.100
Namaste! Aaj ka lesson hai Fractions in a recipe. Fraction ek whole cheez ke barabar hisson mein se kuch hisson ko dikhata hai. Is baat ko dheere-dheere samjhenge, phir ek aasaan example dekhenge. Learning mein galti hona bilkul normal hai; hum har step ko dobara check kar sakte hain.

3
00:00:31.100 --> 00:01:02.200
Aadha cup doodh ka matlab poore cup ke do equal parts mein se ek part hai. Dhyaan do ki example mein kaunsi cheez badal rahi hai aur kaunsi same rehti hai. Pehle apna andaaza bolo, phir reason dhoondo. Agar tum kisi dost ko samjha sakte ho, to concept aur mazboot ho jaata hai.

4
00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:36.822
Recipe ke cup measures draw karo aur har amount ko equal parts ke roop mein label karo. Apne observation ko ek sentence mein likho. Har number ya label ke saath sahi unit ya naam lagao. Sawaal solve karte waqt jaldi mat karo; clue ko underline karo, apna tareeka chuno, aur aakhir mein jawab ko example ke saath compare karo.

5
00:01:36.822 --> 00:02:51.932
Ab practice karo: One-half ko kitne equal fourths ke barabar likh sakte hain? Thoda rukkar socho. Sahi jawab hai 2/4. Baaki options kyun fit nahi hote, yeh bhi apne shabdon mein batao. Fraction ek whole cheez ke barabar hisson mein se kuch hisson ko dikhata hai. Aadha cup doodh ka matlab poore cup ke do equal parts mein se ek part hai. Is idea ko yaad rakhne ke liye apni notebook mein ek chhota labelled drawing banao. Jab tum apne shabdon mein samjha paate ho, tab tumne sirf answer nahi yaad kiya, balki uska reason bhi samjha. Aaj ka chhota recap: Fraction ek whole cheez ke barabar hisson mein se kuch hisson ko dikhata hai. Agli baar aas-paas ki duniya mein isi idea ka ek aur example dhoondhna.

6
